{"type":"message","id":"e4be1e49","parentId":"788390e3","timestamp":"2026-07-03T16:10:05.104Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Sorftime API is back online! I got VN data. Now let me get TH data and also check TikTok verification. Let me also get another page of VN data for more candidates.\n\nFrom the VN data I can see some good candidates:\n1. iLita 3-răng/5-răng claw clip - 1380 monthly sales, 276 7D sales, 0% growth, 25K VND, 4.91 rating - but 0% growth\n2. iLita transparent claw clip - 1053 monthly, 148 7D, 11.31% growth, 20K VND\n\n\n3. iLita túi lưới flower claw clip - 983 monthly, 222 7D, 845% growth (!), 40K VND, 4.90 rating - HOT\n4. Kẹp tóc xà cừ bow acrylic - 683 monthly, 138 7D, 70.32% growth, 26.9K VND, 4.95 rating - good\n5. Eleanor nơ bow clip - 673 monthly, 132 7D, 88.52% growth, 51.5K VND - good\n6. Eleanor nơ cà...\n\nThe nơ bow ribbon clip stands out with its dramatic 845% growth, while the other items show solid growth rates in the 70-88% range. I should pull another page to see what else is performing well, and check Thailand's data at the same time.","thinkingSignature":"121b759f00042524db681ad52b913f54fa965a9098b5266357c1414a6f113747"},{"type":"text","text":"Sorftime API 在线！越南数据已拿到。继续抓泰国数据，同时翻页越南。\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_4jdctbcfaccj_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s -X POST 'https://mcp.sorftime.com/' \\\n  -H \"Authorization: Bearer rhblyi…qt09\" \\\n  -H 'accept: application/json, text/event-stream' \\\n  -H 'Content-Type: application/json' \\\n  -d '{\"jsonrpc\":\"2.0\",\"method\":\"tools/call\",\"params\":{\"name\":\"shopee_product_search\",\"arguments\":{\"site\":\"TH\",\"nodeId\":\"11045697\",\"monthSaleVolumeRangeMin\":50,\"priceRangeMin\":10000,\"page\":1}},\"id\":3}' 2>&1 | head -80","timeout":15}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_4jdctbcfaccj_2","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s -X POST 'https://mcp.sorftime.com/' \\\n  -H \"Authorization: Be