{"type":"message","id":"143a8f07","parentId":"21fc97ef","timestamp":"2026-07-03T16:14:23.458Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The message has been sent. Let me now provide a summary of what I've done and the current status.\n\nActually, I should also provide a summary in this session for completeness.","thinkingSignature":"2c68500e7e7a3c054b242daa782e711f47ad51b5c04dbaf0944bc6224615b1c8"},{"type":"text","text":"选品阶段完成，已发送给 KIIT。\n\n**执行摘要：**\n\n| 项目 | 状态 |\n|------|------|\n| Sorftime 越南 API | ✅ 恢复，数据可用 |\n| Sorftime 泰国 API | ❌ nodeId/关键词双重失效 |\n| TikTok 验证 | ❌ 仍报错（6/13起） |\n| 1688 货源查询 | ❌ 仍报错（6/13起） |\n\n**5个候选（越南）：**\n\n| 排名 | 产品 | 增长率 | 加权分 | 上架 |\n|------|------|--------|--------|------|\n| 🥇 | TMR 包发夹 | **+405%** | 42.40 | 10个月前 |\n| 🥈 | Valley 熊夹 | 0% | 47.75 | 1个月 |\n| 🥉 | Satin 花卉顶髻 | 爆量上新 | 44.18 | 1个月 |\n| 4 | AISHG 三角心形 | +74% | 36.13 | 1个月 |\n\n**泰国数据缺口**：API 无法精准抓取发饰类，返回全类目乱码。已如实说明，未编造。\n\n**关键警告**：v8.0 的「≤6个月上架」筛掉了所有月销>200 的成熟爆品（iLita/越南月销1380=10个月前）。越南发饰真实格局是：新品靠TikTok推爆，成熟品靠跟品出货。两个逻辑并存，选品策略需明确是用「候选池宽进」还是「爆品跟品」。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":80300,"output":373,"cacheRead":54786,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":135459,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1783095252099,"responseId":"069712d4c1d8e7728c66a19b0aea0749","responseModel":"MiniMax-M2.7"}}
